sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Admin
  participant API as Control API
  participant CDB as control schema
  participant CDC as Debezium
  participant Kafka
  participant Orch as Orchestrator
  participant WDB as workflow schema

  Admin->>API: POST replay + admin JWT + reason + idempotency key
  API->>API: Authorize platform administrator
  API->>CDB: Lock dead-letter projection and replay identity

  alt Replay policy prohibits the original failure
    CDB-->>API: replayAllowed = false
    API-->>Admin: 409 REPLAY_NOT_ALLOWED
  else Replay request is admissible
    API->>API: Start new administrative trace
    Note over API,CDB: Link to the original failed trace and never make it the parent.
    API->>CDB: Commit request + command outbox + audit fact
    CDB-->>API: Commit
    API-->>Admin: 202 Accepted + replay request ID

    CDC->>CDB: Read committed replay request outbox
    CDC-)Kafka: Publish provisioning.replay.requested
    Kafka-)Orch: Deliver physical request at generation 0
    Orch->>WDB: Record request receipt and lock dead letter
    Orch->>WDB: Validate stored original contract

    alt Current deployment is incompatible
      Orch->>WDB: Commit rejected authority + resolution outbox
    else Compatible and safe to replay
      Orch->>WDB: Bind request + command hash + outbox ID
      Orch->>WDB: Commit restored command outbox at generation n+1
      Orch->>WDB: Mark dead letter replay_requested
      Note over Orch,WDB: Workflow remains failed or absent until physical command delivery.
      CDC->>WDB: Read committed restored-command outbox
      CDC-)Kafka: Publish original event ID at generation n+1
      Kafka-)Orch: Deliver restored command + outbox-id header
      Orch->>WDB: Verify pending authority, hash, outbox ID, and generation

      alt Restored record does not match authority
        Orch->>WDB: Quarantine hash + broker coordinates
        Note over Orch,WDB: Pending valid authority is not consumed.
      else Restored record matches authority
        Orch->>WDB: Insert generation receipt with Kafka coordinates
        Orch->>WDB: Create or reopen workflow + complete authority
        Orch->>WDB: Commit replay resolution outbox atomically
      end
    end

    opt Rejected request or matching restored command committed a resolution
      CDC->>WDB: Read committed replay resolution
      CDC-)Kafka: Publish provisioning.replay.resolved
      Kafka-)API: Deliver resolution fact
      API->>CDB: Update replay request + owner receipt
      API->>Kafka: Commit offset after owner transaction
      API-->>Admin: GET replay shows completed or rejected
    end
  end
